   "source": [
    "#### Pada tahap selanjutnya saya akan melakukan scalling pada data tersebut, dikarenakan banyaknya outlier pada data tersebut, maka scalling yang tepat digunakan adalah robust, maka dari itu saya akan menggunakan robust untuk scalling."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 27,
   "id": "5a1dd028",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "features = [col for col in df.columns if col not in [\"AT (degree C)\"]]\n",
    "target = ['AT (degree C)']\n",
    "\n",
    "scaler_x = RobustScaler()\n",
    "scaler_y = RobustScaler()\n",
    "\n",
    "df_train[features] = scaler_x.fit_transform(df_train[features])\n",
    "df_train[target] = scaler_y.fit_transform(df_train[target])\n",
    "\n",
    "df_test[features] = scaler_x.transform(df_test[features])\n",
    "df_test[target] = scaler_y.transform(df_test[target])\n",
    "\n",
    "df_val[features] = scaler_x.transform(df_val[features])\n",
    "df_val[target] = scaler_y.transform(df_val[target])\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "e3c1c2dc",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### Setelah dilakukan scalling, dapat dilihat bahwa data telah terdistribusi normal."
