  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "aba29828",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### Membuat dataset agar bisa diload kedalam model, hal tersebut dikarenakan model lstm hanya menerima data dalam bentuk array."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 35,
   "id": "9e98c4b1",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def create_lstm_dataset(df, feature=features, target=target, window_size=WINDOW_SIZE):\n",
    "    X, y = [], []\n",
    "    data = df[feature + target].values\n",
    "    for i in range(window_size, len(df)):\n",
    "        X.append(data[i-window_size: i, :-1])\n",
    "        y.append(data[i, -1])\n",
    "    return np.array(X), np.array(y)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 36,
   "id": "44b027a9",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "(36591, 4896, 4863)"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 36,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "X_train, y_train = create_lstm_dataset(df_train)\n",
    "X_val, y_val = create_lstm_dataset(df_val)\n",
    "X_test, y_test = create_lstm_dataset(df_test)\n",
    "len(X_train), len(X_val), len(X_test)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "482f2646",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Callback yang Digunakan dalam Pemodelan\n",
    "\n",
    "#### 1. **EarlyStopping**\n",
    "Fungsinya adalah untuk menghentikan pelatihan lebih awal jika tidak ada perbaikan pada metrik yang dipantau (misalnya `val_loss`) dalam beberapa epoch berturut-turut. Ini untuk mencegah overfitting dan juga menghemat waktu pelatihan.\n",
    "\n",
    "#### 2. **ModelCheckpoint**\n",
    "Callback ini menyimpan model terbaik berdasarkan metrik yang dipantau selama pelatihan. Model hanya akan disimpan jika ada perbaikan pada metrik yang dipantau, sehingga kita bisa mendapatkan model yang terbaik saat pelatihan selesai."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 37,
   "id": "831bac2c",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "callbacks_baseline = [\n",
    "    EarlyStopping(patience=10, restore_best_weights=True, monitor='val_loss'),\n",
    "    ModelCheckpoint('models/baseline/best_model_.h5', save_best_only=True, monitor='val_loss')\n",
    "]"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "b18ed15b",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### Membuat baseline model dengan hidden size 10 dan output layernya adalah linear."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 38,
   "id": "56385057",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "tf.random.set_seed(42)\n",
    "\n",
    "inputs = layers.Input(shape=(X_train.shape[1], X_train.shape[2]))\n",
    "x = layers.LSTM(10)(inputs)\n",
    "output = layers.Dense(1, activation=\"linear\")(x)\n",
    "model_baseline = tf.keras.Model(inputs=inputs, outputs=output)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "e5137016",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### Untuk optimizer dari modelnya saya akan menggunakan adam dan epsilon."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 39,
   "id": "144bb9e1",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Model: \"model\"\n",
      "_________________________________________________________________\n",
      " Layer (type)                Output Shape              Param #   \n",
      "=================================================================\n",
      " input_1 (InputLayer)        [(None, 5, 20)]           0         \n",
      "                                                                 \n",
      " lstm (LSTM)                 (None, 10)                1240      \n",
      "                                                                 \n",
      " dense (Dense)               (None, 1)                 11        \n",
      "                                                                 \n",
      "=================================================================\n",
      "Total params: 1,251\n",
      "Trainable params: 1,251\n",
      "Non-trainable params: 0\n",
      "_________________________________________________________________\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "optimizer = Adam(learning_rate=0.001, epsilon=1e-7) \n",
    "model_baseline.compile(optimizer=optimizer, loss=\"mse\", metrics=['mae', 'mse']) \n",
    "model_baseline.summary()"
   ]
  },
